OL,3,GNEWSAFerry return delayed by 'complex'
OL,4,Arepairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man's flagship ferry will
OL,7,Fbe out of action for a further two
OL,8,Fmonths, the Steam Packet Company has
OL,9,Fconfirmed, while specialist repairs
OL,10,Ftake place.
OL,12,FThe Manxman has been in dry dock in
OL,13,FLiverpool since 13 July for scheduled
OL,14,Fmaintenance.
OL,16,FThe ferry firm said extensive wear was
OL,17,Fdiscovered after the shafts were
OL,18,Fremoved for inspection. An independent
OL,19,Finvestigation has been launched into
OL,20,Fthe cause.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,448,445,260,140,0,100
